@startuml
title FEATURE-003 Signin - Token et Refresh Token

actor User
participant "Signin UI\n(/signin)" as UI
participant "useSignin" as Hook
participant "NextAuth\nsignIn callback" as NextAuth
participant "OAuth Google Service" as GoogleService
participant "JWT callback" as JWT
participant "Google Token Endpoint" as GoogleToken
database "Firestore User Repo" as Repo

== Credentials Signin ==
User -> UI: Saisit email + mot de passe
UI -> Hook: signinWithCredentials()
Hook -> NextAuth: signIn('credentials')
NextAuth -> Repo: findById(uid)
Repo --> NextAuth: user
NextAuth --> Hook: success / error code
Hook --> UI: SigninResult
UI --> User: Toast + redirect /property

== Google Signin ==
User -> UI: Clique "Continuer avec Google"
UI -> Hook: signinWithGoogle()
Hook -> NextAuth: signIn('google')
NextAuth -> GoogleService: handleGoogleSignIn()
GoogleService -> Repo: create/update user
Repo --> GoogleService: ok
GoogleService --> NextAuth: true or redirect error

== Token Management ==
NextAuth -> JWT: jwt(account, user)
JWT -> JWT: store oauthAccessToken\nstore oauthRefreshToken\nstore oauthAccessTokenExpiresAt

== Automatic Refresh ==
JWT -> JWT: if expires soon?
alt access token expires soon
  JWT -> GoogleToken: POST /token (refresh_token)
  GoogleToken --> JWT: new access_token + expires_in
  JWT -> JWT: update oauthAccessToken\nupdate oauthAccessTokenExpiresAt
else token still valid
  JWT -> JWT: keep current token
end

== Session Exposure ==
JWT -> NextAuth: token with oauth state
NextAuth -> UI: session.auth {provider, tokenStatus, expiresAt, ...}
UI --> User: App consumes useAuthSession/useCurrentUser

@enduml
